     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi everyone</div><div><br></div><div>Instats is offering a free two-day workshop on <a href=\"https://instats.org/seminar/passion-driven-statistics-project-based2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://instats.org/seminar/passion-driven-statistics-project-based2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414360918000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Gc95nJ_8HZVoHruBYTHaO\"><span>Passion</span>-<span>Driven</span> <span>Statistics</span>: Project Based Teaching Tools</a>, running August 15 - 16, by professors Lisa Dierker and Kristin Flaming. Revolutionize the way you teach <span>statistics</span>\r\n with <span>Passion</span>-<span>Driven</span> <span>Statistics</span>, an NSF funded <span>statistics</span> curriculum \r\ndesigned to maximally engage your students and others. This free workshop will empower \r\nyou to: Craft engaging lessons that spark curiosity and exploration; Guide students on real-world research \r\nprojects using large, real-world datasets; ﻿Become a more effective \r\neducator through interactive sessions and networking with peers. Don&#39;t \r\njust teach <span>statistics</span> and methods such as SEM using lavaan, ignite a <span>passion</span> for discovery with this 2-day \r\nworkshop!</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://instats.org/seminar/passion-driven-statistics-project-based2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://instats.org/seminar/passion-driven-statistics-project-based2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414360919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0l1wtQMTkLEiSCz3d726EF\">Sign up today</a> to secure your space in this free workshop, and please feel free to tell your friends and colleagues. <br></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></span></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></span></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Best wishes</span></span><font color=\"#888888\"><font color=\"#888888\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Michael Zyphur<br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Director</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Institute for Statistical and Data Science</span></span></div><div><font size=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(61,133,198)\"><a href=\"http://instats.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://instats.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414360919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UmP-S7x9DKRpa9P5nB2wf\"><b>instats.org</b></a></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;color:rgb(61,133,198)\"><a href=\"http://instats.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://instats.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414360919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UmP-S7x9DKRpa9P5nB2wf\"><b><br></b></a></span></font></div></div></div></div></div></font></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
